hadiths[125]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1399","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Zaynab bint Abi Salama from Umm Salama"
"1400","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab had a dispute brought to him between a muslim and a jew. Umar saw that the right belonged to the jew and decided in his favour. The jew said to him"
"1401","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from his father from Abdullah ibn Amr ibn Uthman from Abu Amra al-Ansari from Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1402","Malik related to me that Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1403","Malik related to me that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1404","Yahya said from Malik that he heard from Sulayman ibn Yasar and others that when they were asked whether the testimony of a man flogged for a hadd crime was permitted"
"1405","Hadith Translation Not available"
"1406","Yahya said"
"1407","From Malik from Abu'z-Zinad that Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz wrote to Abd al-Hamid ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn al-Khattab who was the governor of Kufa"
"1408","Malik related to me that he heard that Abu Salama ibn Abd ar- Rahman and Sulayman ibn Yasar were both asked"
"1409","Yahya said that Malik spoke about a man who died and had a debt owing to him and there was one witness"
"1410","Yahya said"
"1411","Yahya said"
"1412","Malik related to me from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman from Mabad ibn Kab as-Salami from his brother Abdullah ibn Kab ibn Malik al-Ansari from Abu Umama that the Messenger of Allah"
"1413","Yahya said that Malik had said from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that he heard Abu Ghatafan ibn Tarif al-Muriyi say"
"1414","Yahya said"
"1415","Yahya said"
"1416","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1417","Malik related to me from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Muhammad ibn Abdullah ibn Abd al-Qari that his father said"
"1418","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih as- Samman from his father from Abu Hurayra that Sad ibn Ubada said to the Messenger of Allah"
"1419","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that a Syrian man called Ibn Khaybari found a man with his wife and killed him"
"1420","Yahya said that Malik related from Ibn Shihab that Sunayn Abi Jamila"
"1421","Yahya said from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr that A'isha"
"1422","Malik related to me from Yazid ibn Abdullah ibn al-Hadi from Muhammad ibn Ibrahim ibn al-Harith at-Taymi from Sulayman ibn Yasar from Abdullah ibn Abi Umayya that a woman's husband died"
"1423","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar that Umar ibn al-Khattab used to attach the children of the Jahiliyya to whoever claimed them in Islam. Two men came and each of them claimed a woman's child. Umar ibn al-Khattab summoned a person who scrutinized features and he looked at them. The scrutinizer said"
"1424","Malik related to me that he had heard that Umar ibn al-Khattab or Uthman ibn Affan gave a judgement about a slave woman who misled a man about herself and said that she was free. He married her and she bore children. It was decided that he should ransom his children with their like of slaves. Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1425","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1426","Malik related to me from Nafi that Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1427","Yahya related from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1428","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah from his father that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1429","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm that he heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"1430","Malik related to me from Abu'z-Zinad from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1431","Malik related to me from Abu'r-Rijal Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman from his mother Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that she informed him that the Messenger of Allah"
"1432","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1433","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from al-Araj from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1434","Malik related to me from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini from his father that ad-Dahhak ibn Khalifa watered his irrigation ditch from a large source of water. He wanted to have it pass through the land of Muhammad ibn Maslama"
"1435","Malik related to me from Amr ibn Yahya al-Mazini that his father said"
"1436","Yahya related to me from Malik that Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili said"
"1437","Yahya said that he heard Malik speak about a man who died and left properties in Aliya and Safila (outlying districts of Madina). He said"
"1438","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Yahya ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Hatib that some slaves of Hatib stole a she-camel belonging to a man from the Muzayna tribe and they slaughtered it. The case was brought before Umar ibn al-Khattab"
"1439","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1440","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr that A'isha"
"1441","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from Abd ar-Rahman ibn Abd al-Qari that Umar ibn al-Khattab said"
"1442","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1443","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1444","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim ibn Muhammad heard Makhul ad-Dimashqi ask al-Qasim ibn Muhammad about the life pension and what people said about it. Al- Qasim ibn Muhammad said"
"1445","Malik related to me from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar inherited the house of Hafsa bint Umar. He said"
"1446","Malik related to me from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman from Yazid"
"1447","Malik related to me from Ayyub ibn Musa from Muawiya ibn Abdullah ibn Badr al-Juhani that his father informed him that he stopped with a people on the way to Syria and he found a purse which had eighty dinars in it. He mentioned that to Umar ibn al-Khattab. Umar said to him"
"1448","Malik related to me from Nafi that a man found something and went to Abdullah ibn Umar and said to him"
"1449","Yahya said that he heard Malik say"
"1450","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Umar ibn al-Khattab said while he was leaning his back against the Kaba"
"1451","Malik related to me that he heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1452","Malik related to me from Said ibn Amr Shurahbil ibn Said ibn Sad ibn Ubada from his father that his father said"
"1453","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from A'isha"
"1454","Malik related to me that he heard that a man of the Ansar from the tribe of Banu al-Harith ibn al-Khazraj"
"1479","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1480","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that A'isha umm al-muminin wanted to buy a slave-girl and set her free. Her people said"
"1481","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Amra bint Abd ar- Rahman that Barira came asking the help of A'isha"
"1482","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1483","Malik said that it was not permissible for a slave to buy himself from his master on the provision that he could give the wala' to whomever he wished as the wala' was for the one who set him free"
"1484","Malik related to me that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab was asked who had the wala' of the children whom a slave had by a free woman. Said said"
"1485","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm from Abd al-Malik ibn Abi Bakr ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn al- Harith ibn Hisham that his father told him that al-Asi ibn Hisham had died and left three sons"
"1486","Malik related to me from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm that his father told him that he was sitting with Aban ibn Uthman"
"1487","Malik related to me that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab spoke about a man who died and left three sons and left mawali whom he had freed. Then two of his sons died and left children. He said"
"1488","Malik related to me that he had asked Ibn Shihab about a slave who was released. He said"
"1489","Malik related to me from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1490","Malik related to me that he had heard that Urwa ibn az-Zubayr and Sulayman ibn Yasar said"
"1491","Malik related to me from Humayd ibn Qays al-Makki that a son of al-Mutawakkil had a mukatab who died at Makka and left (enough to pay) the rest of his kitaba and he owed some debts to people. He also left a daughter. The governor of Makka was not certain about how to judge in the case"
"1493","Malik said"
"1494","Malik said"
"1495","Malik related to me that he heard Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman and others mention that al-Furafisa ibn Umar al-Hanafi had a mukatab who offered to pay him all of his kitaba that he owed. Al-Furafisa refused to accept it and the mukatab went to Marwan ibn al-Hakam who was the amir of Madina and brought up the matter. Marwan summoned al-Furafisa and told him to accept. He refused. Marwan then ordered that the payment be taken from the mukatab and placed in the treasury. He said to the mukatab ""Go"
"1496","Malik related to me that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab was asked about a mukatab who was shared between two men. One of them freed his portion and then the mukatab died and left a lot of money. Said replied"
"1497","Malik spoke to me about a man who wrote a kitaba for his slave for gold or silver and stipulated against him in his kitaba a journey"
"1498","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"1499","Malik said"
"1500","Malik said in the case of an umm walad who injured someone"
"1501","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Said ibn al-Musayyab that a man from the Aslam tribe came to Abu Bakr as-Siddiq and said to him"
"1502","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Said ibn al-Musayyab said"
"1503","Malik related to me that Ibn Shihab informed him that a man confessed that he had committed adultery in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1504","Malik related to me from Yaqub ibn Zayd ibn Talha from his father Zayd ibn Talha that Abdullah ibn Abi Mulayka informed him that a woman came to the Messenger of Allah"
"1505","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud that Abu Hurayra and Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani informed him that two men brought a dispute to the Messenger of Allah"
"1506","Malik related to me from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that Sad ibn Ubada said to the Messenger of Allah"
"1507","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"1508","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said from Sulayman ibn Yasar from Abu Waqid al-Laythi that a man came to Umar ibn al-Khattab while he was in ash-Sham . He mentioned to him that he had found a man with his wife Umar sent Abu Waqid al-Laythi to the wife to question her about that. He came to her while there were women around her and mentioned to her what her husband had mentioned to Umar ibn al- Khattab"
"1509","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said heard Said ibn al- Musayyab say"
"1510","Malik related to me that he had heard that Uthman ibn Affan was brought a woman who had given birth after six months and he ordered her to be stoned. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him"
"1511","Malik related to me from Zayd ibn Aslam that a man confessed to fornication in the time of the Messenger of Allah"
"1512","Malik related to me from Nafi that Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd informed him that a man who had had intercourse with a virgin slave- girl and made her pregnant was brought to Abu Bakr as-Siddiq. He confessed to fornication"
"1513","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Ubaydullah ibn Abdullah ibn Utba ibn Masud from Abu Hurayra and Zayd ibn Khalid al-Juhani that the Messenger of Allah"
"1514","Malik related to me from Nafi that a slave was in charge of the slaves in the khumus and he forced a slave-girl among those slaves against her will and had intercourse with her. Umar ibn al-Khattab had him flogged and banished him"
"1515","Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Said that Sulayman ibn Yasar informed him that Abdullah ibn Abbas ibn Abi Rabia al-Makhzumi said"
"1516","Malik said"
"1517","Malik related to me from Zurayq ibn Hakim al-Ayli that a man called Misbah asked his son for help and he thought him unnecessarily slow. When the son came"
"1518","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa that his father said that there was only one hadd against a man who slandered a group of people. Malik said"
"1520","Malik said"
"1521","Malik related to me from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1522","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman abu Husayn al-Makki that the Messenger of Allah"
"1523","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from his father from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that a thief stole a citron in the time of Uthman Uthman ibn Affan ordered its value to be estimated and it was estimated at three dirhams at the rate of exchange of twelve dirhams for the dinar"
"1524","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1525","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazim that Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman said"
"1526","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that a slave of Abdullah ibn Umar stole while he was a runaway. Abdullah ibn Umar sent him to Said ibn al-As"
"1527","Yahya related to me from Malik that Zurayq ibn Hakim informed him that he had a runaway slave who had stolen. He said"
"1529","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Safwan ibn Abdullah ibn Safwan that it was said to Safwan ibn Umayya"
"1530","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that az-Zubayr ibn al-Awwam came across a man who had taken hold of a thief and was intending to take him to the Sultan. Az-Zubayr ibn al- Awwam interceded for him to let him go. He said"
"1531","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that a man from Yemen who had his hand and foot cut off came and went before Abu Bakr as-Siddiq and complained to him that the governor of the Yemen had wronged him"
"1532","Yahya related to me from Malik that Abu'z-Zinad informed him that a governor of Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz took some people in battle and had not killed any of them. He wanted to cut off their hands or kill them"
"1533","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Muhammad ibn Yahya ibn Habban that a slave stole a small palm from a man's garden and planted it in the garden of his master. The owner of the palm went out looking for the palm and found it. He asked for help against the slave from Marwan ibn al-Hakam. Marwan jailed the slave and wanted to cut off his hand. The master of the slave rushed off to Rafi ibn Khadij and asked him about it. Rafi informed him that he heard the Messenger of Allah"
"1534","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid that Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-Hadrami brought a slave of his to Umar ibn al-Khattab and said to him"
"1535","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Marwan ibn al-Hakam was brought a man who had snatched some goods and he wanted to cut off his hand. He sent to Zayd ibn Thabit to ask him about it. Zayd ibn Thabit said to him"
"1536","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm informed him that he had taken a Nabatean who had stolen some iron rings and jailed him in order to cut off his hand. Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman sent a girl mawla to him called Umayya. Abu Bakr said that she had come to him while he was among the people and said that his aunt Amra sent word to him saying"
"1537","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that as-Sa'ib ibn Yazid informed him that Umar ibn al-Khattab came out to them. He said"
"1538","Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Umar ibn al-Khattab asked advice about a man drinking wine. Ali ibn Abi Talib said to him"
"1539","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the hadd of the slave for wine. He said"
"1540","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say"
"1541","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1542","Yahya related to me from Malik from al-Ala ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Yaqub from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1543","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1544","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hubab al-Ansari from Abu Qatada al-Ansari that the Messenger of Allah"
"1545","Yahya related to me from Malik from ibn Shihab from Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha"
"1546","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam from Ata ibn Yasar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1547","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1548","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ibn Wala al-Misri asked Abdullah ibn Abbas about what is squeezed from the grapes. Ibn Abbas replied"
"1549","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha that Anas ibn Malik said"
"1550","Yahya related to me from Malik from Da'ud ibn al-Husayn that Waqid ibn Amr ibn Sad ibn Muadh informed him from Mahmud ibn Labid al- Ansari that when Umar ibn al-Khattab went to ash-Sham"